WEBVTT

00:00:04.205 --> 00:00:11.053
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Now, let’s go upstairs. Follow me. Be careful.

00:00:11.301 --> 00:00:13.805
The ceiling is very low here.

00:00:14.319 --> 00:00:15.973
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> It’s a very old house.

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:20.492
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Yes, the house is 300 years old.

00:00:21.463 --> 00:00:24.758
My family lived here for nearly 80 years.

00:00:25.541 --> 00:00:30.177
There are six bedrooms. This was my father’s bedroom.

00:00:31.211 --> 00:00:33.251
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> Is there heat in the house?

00:00:33.804 --> 00:00:35.317
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Yes, there is.

00:00:36.178 --> 00:00:39.156
Why do you ask? Are you cold?

00:00:39.516 --> 00:00:42.266
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> Yes, it’s very cold in here.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:45.196
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> That’s because we’re from California.

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:49.110
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Let’s go and see the other bedrooms.

00:00:49.619 --> 00:00:50.836
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Yes, of course. ...

00:00:54.408 --> 00:00:57.677
Well, what do you think, Kim? I love it! Don’t you?

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:02.691
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> I’m not sure. There’s something about the house I don’t like.

00:01:03.239 --> 00:01:05.415
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> Kim, it’s perfect for the kids.

00:01:05.637 --> 00:01:10.005
Think of the yard. And it’s a real authentic country house.

00:01:10.327 --> 00:01:11.250
What do you say?

00:01:11.831 --> 00:01:14.845
<v><b>Kim:</b></v> I suppose so. If you’re sure.

00:01:15.089 --> 00:01:16.211
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> I am sure!

00:01:16.659 --> 00:01:22.126
Miss…uh, Barbara. We want it. We want to rent the house.

00:01:22.574 --> 00:01:23.650
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Excellent.

00:01:24.078 --> 00:01:25.393
<v><b>Leo:</b></v> When can we move in?

00:01:25.828 --> 00:01:27.339
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> As soon as you like.